                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "[h1] Not for Achievement Hunters [/h1]\r\nDon't expect to 100% this game.  One of the achievements requires you to finish the day at the top of the leaderboard.  There is always someone there with an absurdly high score who either cheats or is extremely dedicated (often posting the score at the last second, giving you false hope).  It's usually the same person who already 100%'d the game years ago.  This issue has been raised with the developer several times and he thinks it's fine.  If you don't want this game to drag down your average, don't play it or buy it!  \r\n\r\nOther than that, it is a relatively simple game.  You will see all there is to see in less than 30 minutes.",
